### ResQLens API smoke requests (VS Code "REST Client" extension: click "Send Request")
@base = http://localhost:8000/api

### Health (no auth)
GET {{base}}/health

### Login with the demo account – copy "token" into @token below
# @name login
POST {{base}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "demo@resqlens.dev", "password": "Demo@2026" }

###
@token = {{login.response.body.token}}

### Projects
GET {{base}}/projects
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Dashboard
GET {{base}}/dashboard
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
